  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Ice Golem is the eighth Dark Elixir Troop unlocked once the Dark Barracks is upgraded to level 8, which requires Town Hall level 11. He is a slow-moving ground troop with low damage and high hitpoints that prioritizes defenses."
  ],
